              This statement amounts to saying that the underlying simplicial set of any simplicial group is a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+complex"} Kan complex
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "simplicial+group#EverySimplicialGroupIsAKanComplex"} here
          %h4#Cofibrations Cofibrations
          %p
