            %a{:href => "#GoerssJardine99"}> Goerss-Jardine 99, Chapter V, Prop. 6.3
            )
          %h3#relation_to_simplicial_groupoids Relation to simplicial groupoids
          %p
          .num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              Forming simplicial
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping+groupoids"} delooping groupoids
              constitutes a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fully+faithful+functor"} fully faithful functor
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-categories"} 1-categories
